<p class="MsoNormal">
    The College bears the Motto “Labor Omnia Vincit”, meaning “Hard Work conquers 
    All”. With an abiding faith in the efficacy of her labours, the college strives 
    hard to impart value based education aimed at the formation of the integral 
    personality of the student. With the willing co-operation of parents and the 
    whole hearted support of the public, the college hopes to march triumphantly in 
    its noble endeavour.<o:p></o:p></p>
